WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
A little flag on a grid.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.820
Multiply every point by the matrix nought,

3
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.130
minus one, one, nought.

4
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.630
The flag turns.

5
00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.450
Now use three, nought, nought, two.

6
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.520
The same flag stretches.

7
00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:16.250
And minus one, nought, nought, one.

8
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.990
This time it flips.

9
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.960
Each time it's just four numbers in a box.

10
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:24.510
So how could you predict the
effect before drawing anything?

11
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.150
In this mission, you'll multiply a matrix
by a point written as a column vector.

12
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.390
And you'll keep a close
eye on two humble points:

13
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.520
one, nought, and nought, one.

14
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:39.040
Your mission: work out how to tell
whether a two by two matrix will rotate,

15
00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.590
stretch or flip.
